diatype":"audio","collection":["hiphopradioarchive","radioprograms"],"creator":"Dr. Dre","date":"1987-02-10","description":"<span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">This is not just another old school radio show. The operating room shows from Dr. Dre are very hard to find. And this one is imo very special. It contains an interview with KRS and Scott La Rock (6 months before his death) about the bridge wars, one of the important chapters of hip hop history.</span><div><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Georgia, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;\"><br /></span></font><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\">Scott is dissing Mr Magic, Shan and the Juice Crew and KRS is talking about The bridge and the reason to write 'the bridge is over'.</div><div style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:13px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br /><div>This is like a time capsule back to 1987.</div><div><br /></div><div>- Dutch</div></div></div>","language":"eng","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":["hip-hop","radio","WBAU","new york","operating room","dr. dre","t-money"],"title":"The Operating Room (Dr. Dre): February 10, 1987","publicdate":"2017-07-31 04:07:26","uploader":"rmacmich@gmail.com","addeddate":"2017-07-31 04:07:26","year":"1987","hhra_title":"The Operating Room","hhra_callletters":"WBAU","hhra_stationfreq":"90.3 FM","hhra_location":"New York, NY, USA","hhra_credit":"Dutch","hhra_sourceurl":"http://old-school-hiphop-tapes.blogspot.com/2009/08/dr-dre-operation-room-show-with-krs-one.html","backup_location":"ia906500_31","hhra_featuring":"KRS-One, Scott LaRock","hhra_djshosts":"Doctor Dré"},"reviews":[{"reviewtitle":"EPIC","reviewbody":"I have A few cassettes some where from 1986.  I remember A segment they had in which The I.R.S would play their mixes of edits.  Thanks for sharing","stars":"5","reviewer":"OuchMashUps","reviewdate":"2021-05-18 22:18:50","createdate":"2021-05-18 22:18:50","reviewer_itemname":"@ouchmashups"}],"server":"ia600606.us.archive.org","uniq":450895505,"workable_servers":["ia600606.us.archive.org","ia800606.us.archive.org"]}